`field.override.number.*` on a **numbering block** renames the fields that block
publishes (ADR-0016 rule 2, S2-9.3). It has to live there — not in the
element's `custom` entry — because a `%%` group is declared once for a whole
task: the counter is the only place that knows every element it will number.

